    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Only Weapon Is a Phone, Your Only Ally Is a Mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the labyrinthine facilities of Cerberus Corporation. In your hand, <i>a cellphone</i>\u2014and cryptic messages from an anonymous figure calling themselves &quot;The Savior.&quot; You <i>have</i> to trust their instructions: They might open doors in the labyrinth\u2026 or lead you into deadly traps. <strong>Help or a threat?</strong> You won\u2019t know until it\u2019s too late. Your phone is your <i>flashlight</i>, your <i>hacking tool</i>, and your <i>distraction device</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light the Darkness, Shatter the Silence:</strong> Activate TVs via Bluetooth, blast music players, and throw objects to divert attention\u2026 but stay <i>unseen</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Evidence, Unravel Secrets:</strong> Notes scrawled on walls hint at the company\u2019s &quot;innocent&quot; operations. Old newspapers and encrypted files whisper of Cerberus\u2019 <i>dark trade</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Trust The Savior?</strong> The voice behind the messages\u2026 <i>A fellow victim, or part of Cerberus\u2019 game?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember:</strong> Every step you take is watched. The cameras don\u2019t see you\u2026 but <i>people</i> do. Hide. Deceive. Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cYour escape might be a beginning. But it\u2019s not the end Cerberus has planned for you\u2026</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Only Weapon Is a Phone, Your Only Ally Is a Mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the labyrinthine facilities of Cerberus Corporation. In your hand, <i>a cellphone</i>\u2014and cryptic messages from an anonymous figure calling themselves &quot;The Savior.&quot; You <i>have</i> to trust their instructions: They might open doors in the labyrinth\u2026 or lead you into deadly traps. <strong>Help or a threat?</strong> You won\u2019t know until it\u2019s too late. Your phone is your <i>flashlight</i>, your <i>hacking tool</i>, and your <i>distraction device</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light the Darkness, Shatter the Silence:</strong> Activate TVs via Bluetooth, blast music players, and throw objects to divert attention\u2026 but stay <i>unseen</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Evidence, Unravel Secrets:</strong> Notes scrawled on walls hint at the company\u2019s &quot;innocent&quot; operations. Old newspapers and encrypted files whisper of Cerberus\u2019 <i>dark trade</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Trust The Savior?</strong> The voice behind the messages\u2026 <i>A fellow victim, or part of Cerberus\u2019 game?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember:</strong> Every step you take is watched. The cameras don\u2019t see you\u2026 but <i>people</i> do. Hide. Deceive. Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cYour escape might be a beginning. But it\u2019s not the end Cerberus has planned for you\u2026</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Prepare to Escape from the Heart of Darkness. Trapped in Cerberus Corporation's facilities , use wit and instinct to survive a ruthless maze where death is sold. Screams behind walls, cold camera lenses, humanity vanishing under the shadow of wealth\u2026 Uncover the truth. Or perish with it",
